<%- include('./partials/deadline-head', {
  title: 'New Property Listed',
  heading: 'A new property has been added to your account.'
}) %>

<p>An administrator has listed a new property under your account on <%= appName %>. You can now manage its availability, set your minimum bid, and track bookings from your dashboard.</p>

<div class="property-card">
  <p class="label">New Property</p>
  <p class="name"><%= placeName %></p>
  <p class="location"><%= placeCity %>, <%= placeCountry %></p>
</div>

<p>Head to your dashboard to review the listing details, update availability, and configure your bidding preferences.</p>

<%- include('./partials/deadline-button', { url: dashboardUrl, label: 'Go to My Dashboard' }) %>

<div class="divider"></div>

<p>If you believe this was added in error, please contact our support team.</p>

<%- include('./partials/deadline-foot', { appName: appName }) %>
